% holding-blocked: The original is fully notated with words on every note, and the listening link is Piranha Records' official upload of the remastered 1987 recording, but it has not been tried with students. A Grade 2 classroom teacher must trial the mirror form, the half notes and the bordun at 76-88; a Zimbabwean mbira educator must review the context and the boundary between a pentatonic classroom bordun and mbira repertoire, and how to speak of chimurenga with seven-year-olds; a second score reader must check the notes, words and cues.
